			<trans-unit id="tx_jobboard_domain_model_job.salary_min.description">
				<source>For an exact salary, please enter the same amount in both minimum and maximum salary. Since jobs without salary information may no longer be displayed by law, both fields must be filled in. You may enter the amount with a thousands separator and decimal comma (e.g. 3.842,17) — it is normalized automatically once you leave the field.</source>
